742 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Flowchart depicting a process for dataset analysis. It begins with data preprocessing, leading to feature extraction. The diagram splits into three pathways: DOA, FCM DOA SVM, and NCM DOA SVM. Each involves data split, clustering, enhanced data split, DOA parameter optimization, and SVM classification. All paths converge into model evaluation and performance measures assessment.) /K 805 0 R /P 242 0 R /Pg 229 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
743 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Close-up images of fingerprints under different color filters. Each of the six panels shows a fingerprint with visible ridges, illuminated by various shades of blue, green, pink, and purple light.) /K 806 0 R /P 242 0 R /Pg 230 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
744 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Diagram showing the process of generating HOG \(Histogram of Oriented Gradients\) features. It starts with an input image, zooms into a section for analyzing cells, calculates gradient directions and magnitudes, then visualizes these as a histogram \(HOG feature\). The process concludes with an output image displaying HOG features.) /K 807 0 R /P 242 0 R /Pg 230 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
745 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Three scatter plots illustrate different membership values based on PCA features. The top left plot shows Truth Membership with a gradient from light to dark red. The top right plot displays Indeterminacy Membership with a blue gradient. The bottom plot depicts Falsity Membership using a green gradient. Each plot has axes labeled Feature 1 and Feature 2.) /K 808 0 R /P 242 0 R /Pg 238 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
